verses.text:
Gen 1:26-27
26 Then God said,"Let <strong>Us make mankind</strong>
in <strong>Our image</strong>,
according to <strong>Our likeness</strong>;
let them have <strong>dominion</strong> over the fish of the sea,
over the birds of the air, and over the cattle,
<strong>over all the earth</strong> and over every creeping thing that creeps on the earth."
27 So <strong>God created man</strong> in His own image;
in the image of <strong>God He created him</strong>;
male and female <strong>He created them</strong>.
